Priod
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
OJA 9 FACE_HALF
OJA 4 FACE_HALF
OJA 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJA 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OJA OJA
DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK OJA OJA
DESTSRC Suit match_color
$win
OR
    PILE ALL OJA Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL OJA Empty
        PILE ALL OJA Empty
